{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-09-18T03:19:48.560Z","author":"pi-agent","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"pi","agent_model":"glm-5.2:cloud","agent_model_source":"environment","agent_instance":"bf508fc18bdbc741e44074d5","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"glm-5.2:cloud","source":"environment"},"effort":null,"role":null,"topic":null},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments/1","value":{"created_at":"2026-09-18T03:19:48.560Z","author":"pi-agent","text":"Dead-code removed: index.ts lines 1932-1957 (beforeCommand fallback hook). Invariant: the SDK's ExtensionApiRegistrar constructor always binds api.hooks.afterCommand as a function (see @unbrained/pm-cli extension-types.js: this.hooks = { beforeCommand: ..., afterCommand: ..., ... }), so the 'else if (typeof api.hooks?.beforeCommand === \"function\")' branch is never reached when afterCommand is available. The peer dependency >=2026.7.29 guarantees afterCommand exists. Removed the entire else-if block and the unused BeforeCommandHookContext import."}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-09-18T03:19:48.560Z"}],"before_hash":"697ac945ea0bd5f5d991499d6ac3a7f06b23caa11fffc987b64b8713bc2d1efd","after_hash":"68697107f46af4c34a19adec0d0e33847dfea9f35b145017a2b14c610e5e08b4","item_hash_version":3,"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"e65cc62933c8c4c08b9d3d3f30759a52cf76124d88ef24682f5042f79e599123"}
{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-09-18T04:27:33.963Z","author":"pi-agent","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"pi","agent_model":"glm-5.2:cloud","agent_model_source":"environment","agent_instance":"bf508fc18bdbc741e44074d5","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"glm-5.2:cloud","source":"environment"},"effort":null,"role":null,"topic":null},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments/2","value":{"created_at":"2026-09-18T04:27:33.963Z","author":"pi-agent","text":"Coverage achieved 100/100/100 (lines/branches/functions). Dead code removed: (1) beforeCommand fallback hook (lines 1932-1957) — invariant: SDK always provides afterCommand; (2) postToSlack throw ternary (line 1369) — invariant: postToSlackOnce only rejects with Error instances; (3) res.statusCode ?? 0 — invariant: HTTP responses always have a status code; (4) statusIsClosed ?? '' — invariant: aggregateDigest always passes a lowercased string; (5) ALL_EVENTS.find(...) ?? 'create' (2 sites) — invariant: parseEvents always returns a non-empty set of valid EventKind values. Introduced toErrorMessage() helper consolidating err instanceof Error ternaries from 4 catch blocks; exported in __test__ with both arms tested. Coverage gate raised to 100/100/100."}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-09-18T04:27:33.963Z"}],"before_hash":"68697107f46af4c34a19adec0d0e33847dfea9f35b145017a2b14c610e5e08b4","after_hash":"a4d3eb999d62b897b0d508bbe17c7dedf8fa9e87cd50d717e5eaf59a459e0ecd","item_hash_version":3,"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"9a1a8e50b2a18d95b939ed284b228c98a1269628049d628f9c61bb9d7bd158e8"}
